      "text": "2. STAR Answer Structure",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. STAR Answer Structure",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "id2849354",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 855.515625,
      "y": -119.359375,
      "width": 551.0515747070312,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 4298941,
      "version": 94,
      "versionNonce": 568196645,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784077357092,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "S — Situation\nModel owners could not quickly answer:\n“Is my model healthy, what changed, and what should I do?”\n\nT — Task\nCreate a unified experience that remained trustworthy even\nwhen data was slow, stale, or partially unavailable.\n\nA — Action\n• Designed progressive rendering and section-level isolation\n• Standardized healthy/degraded/stale/unknown semantics\n• Reduced GraphQL waterfalls and payload size\n• Built reusable entity, health, freshness, and table primitives\n• Aligned MLOps, DQ, Legal, RAIG, serving, and CI teams\n\nR — Result\n• Active-model workflow: ~12–15s → <4s\n• Registered-model page: ~10s → ~2s\n• Faster debugging, more consistent experiences, and reusable\n  components for future MLOps surfaces",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "S — Situation\nModel owners could not quickly answer:\n“Is my model healthy, what changed, and what should I do?”\n\nT — Task\nCreate a unified experience that remained trustworthy even\nwhen data was slow, stale, or partially unavailable.\n\nA — Action\n• Designed progressive rendering and section-level isolation\n• Standardized healthy/degraded/stale/unknown semantics\n• Reduced GraphQL waterfalls and payload size\n• Built reusable entity, health, freshness, and table primitives\n• Aligned MLOps, DQ, Legal, RAIG, serving, and CI teams\n\nR — Result\n• Active-model workflow: ~12–15s → <4s\n• Registered-model page: ~10s → ~2s\n• Faster debugging, more consistent experiences, and reusable\n  components for future MLOps surfaces",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
