      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. GraphQL Optimization Strategy",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. GraphQL Optimization Strategy",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "id4096340",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 866.09765625,
      "y": 434.6875,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 9718558,
      "version": 86,
      "versionNonce": 1851495339,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784077379465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Principles\n• Fetch only data required by visible UI\n• Colocate data with components via fragments\n• Preload route-critical queries before rendering\n• Lazy-load data for tabs, drawers, and below-the-fold sections\n• Avoid over-fetching and nested resolver waterfalls\n• Normalize pagination and stable IDs\n• Add server timing and operation-level telemetry\n\nWhen to use\n• usePreloadedQuery / preloadQuery:\n  start network work during navigation\n• useLazyLoadQuery:\n  route or section owns immediate fetch\n• useFragment:\n  child declares exact data dependency\n• refetch / pagination fragments:\n  filters, refresh, and cursor-based lists\n• @defer / streamed payloads:\n  render critical summary before secondary fields",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Principles\n• Fetch only data required by visible UI\n• Colocate data with components via fragments\n• Preload route-critical queries before rendering\n• Lazy-load data for tabs, drawers, and below-the-fold sections\n• Avoid over-fetching and nested resolver waterfalls\n• Normalize pagination and stable IDs\n• Add server timing and operation-level telemetry\n\nWhen to use\n• usePreloadedQuery / preloadQuery:\n  start network work during navigation\n• useLazyLoadQuery:\n  route or section owns immediate fetch\n• useFragment:\n  child declares exact data dependency\n• refetch / pagination fragments:\n  filters, refresh, and cursor-based lists\n• @defer / streamed payloads:\n  render critical summary before secondary fields",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
