      "text": "11. Likely Interview Questions",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "11. Likely Interview Questions",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "id9297801",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1314.1243283889678,
      "y": 1924.7257967732048,
      "width": 518.2446899414062,
      "height": 233.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "al",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8089643,
      "version": 134,
      "versionNonce": 1222163803,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784130262955,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Tell me about a complex web experience you built.\n• How did you improve a slow page from 12–15s to under 4s?\n• How do you decide what should become a shared component?\n• How do you handle partial and stale data?\n• How would you render 50K chart points?\n• When would you use GraphQL preloading vs lazy loading?\n• How do you prevent request waterfalls?\n• How do you measure FE reliability?\n• How do you drive adoption across teams?\n• How do you balance accessibility with virtualization?\n• How would you roll out a risky frontend platform migration?",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Tell me about a complex web experience you built.\n• How did you improve a slow page from 12–15s to under 4s?\n• How do you decide what should become a shared component?\n• How do you handle partial and stale data?\n• How would you render 50K chart points?\n• When would you use GraphQL preloading vs lazy loading?\n• How do you prevent request waterfalls?\n• How do you measure FE reliability?\n• How do you drive adoption across teams?\n• How do you balance accessibility with virtualization?\n• How would you roll out a risky frontend platform migration?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "id2364274",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1874.04296875,
      "y": 1897.38671875,
      "width": 382.72076416015625,
      "height": 276.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "am",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 837149,
      "version": 49,
      "versionNonce": 219398155,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784128261505,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Answer framework\n1. Clarify user and critical decision\n2. Define success metrics and SLO\n3. Describe architecture and state ownership\n4. Deep dive on performance/reliability\n5. Explain trade-offs\n6. Show organizational leverage\n7. End with rollout, adoption, and impact\n\nClosing message\n“I improve the immediate user workflow,\nthen convert repeated solutions into\nreliable foundations for the organization.”",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Answer framework\n1. Clarify user and critical decision\n2. Define success metrics and SLO\n3. Describe architecture and state ownership\n4. Deep dive on performance/reliability\n5. Explain trade-offs\n6. Show organizational leverage\n7. End with rollout, adoption, and impact\n\nClosing message\n“I improve the immediate user workflow,\nthen convert repeated solutions into\nreliable foundations for the organization.”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
