      "versionNonce": 455068485,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784128493206,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Types of Front-End Performance Bottlenecks ***\n\nPerformance issues can come from many sources. You want to consider:\n* Network bottlenecks: Large payloads, slow APIs, or too many requests.\n* Rendering bottlenecks: Too much DOM, inefficient updates, or unoptimized rendering cycles.\n* JavaScript execution: Heavy libraries, unnecessary code, or blocking scripts.\n* Asset delivery: Large images, fonts, or video assets that slow down page loads.\n* Device constraints: Slow CPUs, low memory, or poor graphics on specific user devices.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Types of Front-End Performance Bottlenecks ***\n\nPerformance issues can come from many sources. You want to consider:\n* Network bottlenecks: Large payloads, slow APIs, or too many requests.\n* Rendering bottlenecks: Too much DOM, inefficient updates, or unoptimized rendering cycles.\n* JavaScript execution: Heavy libraries, unnecessary code, or blocking scripts.\n* Asset delivery: Large images, fonts, or video assets that slow down page loads.\n* Device constraints: Slow CPUs, low memory, or poor graphics on specific user devices.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
