      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784130451944,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** GraphQL preloading vs Lazy loading for charts and monitoring ***\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** GraphQL preloading vs Lazy loading for charts and monitoring ***\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "v_bdZ6qMWfeY-m3b5nZiO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 58.23783014581625,
      "y": 4617.250908796572,
      "width": 1146.5592041015625,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b06",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1015602165,
      "version": 60,
      "versionNonce": 1839479125,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784130534358,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Use Preloading When\nFetch data before the chart component renders when the data is predictable and important to the initial experience.\n\nBest for:\n* Above-the-fold monitoring charts\n* Primary dashboard KPIs\n* Default time range is known\n* Data is likely to be viewed\n* Avoiding request waterfalls\n* Route transitions where the next screen is predictable\n\n*** Use lazyload when: \nFetch data only when the chart becomes necessary.\n\nBest for:\n* Below-the-fold charts\n* Collapsed tabs or accordions\n* Optional drill-down panels\n* Expensive high-cardinality queries\n* User-selected models, metrics, or time ranges\n* Dashboards containing many charts",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Use Preloading When\nFetch data before the chart component renders when the data is predictable and important to the initial experience.\n\nBest for:\n* Above-the-fold monitoring charts\n* Primary dashboard KPIs\n* Default time range is known\n* Data is likely to be viewed\n* Avoiding request waterfalls\n* Route transitions where the next screen is predictable\n\n*** Use lazyload when: \nFetch data only when the chart becomes necessary.\n\nBest for:\n* Below-the-fold charts\n* Collapsed tabs or accordions\n* Optional drill-down panels\n* Expensive high-cardinality queries\n* User-selected models, metrics, or time ranges\n* Dashboards containing many charts",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ug-jkmKXcfvbXN1klYLBE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 727.9945662563623,
      "y": 4701.843153280278,
      "width": 304.84824220297025,
      "height": 154.8502325198533,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b07",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 652891035,
      "version": 191,
      "versionNonce": 412588251,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784130813523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "const queryRef = loadQuery(environment, DashboardQuery, {\n  modelId,\n  range: \"24h\",\n});\n\nfunction Dashboard() {\n  return (\n    <Suspense fallback={<ChartSkeleton />}>\n      <LatencyChart queryRef={queryRef} />\n    </Suspense>\n  );\n}",
      "fontSize": 10.323348834656885,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "const queryRef = loadQuery(environment, DashboardQuery, {\n  modelId,\n  range: \"24h\",\n});\n\nfunction Dashboard() {\n  return (\n    <Suspense fallback={<ChartSkeleton />}>\n      <LatencyChart queryRef={queryRef} />\n    </Suspense>\n  );\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
