    {
      "id": "QISozZNjPgIzxE6rCBu6H",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 771.3185474611954,
      "y": 4974.339020523689,
      "width": 653.5033569335938,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1424009979,
      "version": 62,
      "versionNonce": 890278101,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784130775646,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hybrid Approach\n\n1. Preload summary metrics and the primary chart.\n2. Lazy load charts below the fold.\n3. Prefetch optional charts when the browser is idle or the user hovers over a tab.\n4. Refetch only when filters or time ranges change.\n5. Cancel or ignore stale requests during rapid filter changes.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hybrid Approach\n\n1. Preload summary metrics and the primary chart.\n2. Lazy load charts below the fold.\n3. Prefetch optional charts when the browser is idle or the user hovers over a tab.\n4. Refetch only when filters or time ranges change.\n5. Cancel or ignore stale requests during rapid filter changes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
